{
  "$comment": "scripts/formal/changed.mjs reads 'always' (path prefixes) and, for each model, 'spec', 'configs', and 'covers[].path' (exact file paths, or prefixes that end in '/'). A change to any of them runs the formal gate. 'functions' and 'actions' are a guide for reviewers; the gate matches files only.",
